Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.88,0:01:23.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,放轻松\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Easy, now.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.41,0:01:26.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,放轻松 小伙子们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Easy, boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.22,0:01:32.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好啦 放轻松\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Easy, now.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.76,0:01:39.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,出什么事了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.83,0:01:45.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,紧急警报 紧急警报 我们这儿有情...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Code red. Code red. We got a sit...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.91,0:02:06.08,Default,NTP,0,0,9,!Effect,(安全系统被破坏 紧急警报)
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.52,0:02:08.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,长官 周边地区被突破\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sir, we have a breach in the perimeter.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.36,0:02:15.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,全部进入警戒状态! 清空所有硬盘数据 进入一级戒备\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go secure. Sweep the hard drives. Lock us down.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.10,0:02:17.85,Default,NTP,0,0,9,!Effect,(一级戒备)
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.19,0:02:48.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,到处都是红外线影像 所有的走廊都是他们的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Heat signatures everywhere. They've covered all the halls.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.06,0:02:50.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,看来我们要来个"大清洗"了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then I guess we better clear the halls.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.94,0:02:58.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,行动!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.47,0:03:35.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,马上疏散!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Evacuate! Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.35,0:03:49.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,来吧只要你敢走出那扇门 我让你好看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on. I dare you to come walking through that door. Come get some.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.59,0:03:52.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,钥匙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Keys.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.06,0:03:55.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 我们到底惹了谁了 长官? - 上车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Who the hell did we piss off this time? - Get in.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.63,0:03:59.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 这玩意儿带武器吗? - 当然\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- This thing armed? - Always.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.50,0:04:01.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好样的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good man.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.49,0:04:22.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你见过这种东西吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You ever seen one of these?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.52,0:04:24.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,做梦见过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Only in my dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.99,0:04:28.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,微型热像仪 水中数据传导器 480转\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Geothermal micro cam, Aquacade uplinks, 480 gigs.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.90,0:04:31.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这玩意儿比国家安全局的还先进十倍\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sir, this thing is 10 generations beyond the NSA.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.10,0:04:34.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那就是说不管谁袭击了我们 都是有备而来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So whoever attacked us is loaded for war.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.27,0:04:37.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,而且很清楚从哪下手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And they knew exactly where to hit us.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.41,0:04:39.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们现在要找个接班人了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We gotta go off the grid now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.21,0:04:42.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不会再是什么溜冰 滑板 或者自行车之类的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not another skater, snowboarder or biker.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.24,0:04:44.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,新一代的XXX要更有危胁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The new XXX has gotta be more dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.81,0:04:46.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,更致命更有型\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Deadlier. More attitude.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.85,0:04:48.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,更有型?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}More attitude?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.65,0:04:52.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们到哪儿才能找到这种人啊?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where the hell are we gonna find that?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.46,0:05:16.84,Default,NTP,0,0,9,!Effect,《极限特工2：极限公国》
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.68,0:06:30.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,您中午要和国家环保署开会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have a meeting with the EPA at noon...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.85,0:06:32.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- ...讨论... - 他们只有那个能耐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- ...to discuss... - A tree is a tree.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.75,0:06:34.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,还能指望他们多考虑什么呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How many more can they look at?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.39,0:06:36.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,您的周年纪念日 要玫瑰还是郁金香?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your anniversary, roses or tulips?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.52,0:06:39.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,乔治郁金香 黄色的谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}George. Tulips, yellow. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.16,0:06:42.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,国安局的一个分部刚刚被袭\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}An NSA chapter was just hit.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.46,0:06:44.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,死了十六个特工\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sixteen agents, all dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.70,0:06:46.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,十六个我们的人?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sixteen of our men?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.83,0:06:49.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,在我们自己的地盘上? 怎么会发生这种事儿?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}On our own soil? How the hell did this happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.54,0:06:51.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我正在调查\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm looking into it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.54,0:06:54.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 有嫌疑对象吗? - 太多了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Suspects? - Too many.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.11,0:06:57.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这件事需要我操心吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How concerned do I need to be?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.38,0:07:00.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我会处理的 干净利落而且保密\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll take care of it. Quick and clean. And contained.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.15,0:07:04.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真该死 居然死了16个!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Goddamn it, 16 men?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.02,0:07:06.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,还会死多少?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How many more have to die?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.82,0:07:09.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,预算会议取消\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is no longer a budget meeting.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.59,0:07:12.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,国防部长刚刚通知我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The secretary of defense has just informed me...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.19,0:07:15.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,有16个国家安全局特工被杀了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...that 16 of our NSA agents were killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.66,0:07:16.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,就在弗吉尼亚州\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}ln Virginia.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.06,0:07:21.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,嫌疑犯几乎遍布半个世界\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is a laundry list of suspects that covers half the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.80,0:07:25.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是该改变政策的时候了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}lt's time for a new direction.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.44,0:07:29.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,新的军事财政预算是新政策的关键\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The new military bill is critical to that direction.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.61,0:07:33.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,所以 这将写入我这星期发表的国情咨文\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So it's going in my State of the Union address this week.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.88,0:07:41.29,Default,NTP,0,0,9,!Effect,(美国军事监狱 最高警戒区)
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.80,0:07:50.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,请让我们单独待一会儿 律师会面 有这个特权\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Some privacy, please. Attorney-client privilege.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.24,0:08:04.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,很高兴再次见到你 上尉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good to see you again, lieutenant.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.45,0:08:09.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,已经多久了? 9年?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How long has it been? Nine years?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.12,0:08:11.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,还不够久\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not long enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.12,0:08:13.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,而且不许再叫我上尉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And don't call me "lieutenant."
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.05,0:08:16.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我现在是3655号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm inmate 3655 now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.16,0:08:20.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你来这儿干什么 吉本斯? 你想要什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What you doing here, Gibbons? What you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.63,0:08:23.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,要你我要给你个工作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You. I wanna give you a job.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.60,0:08:25.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我为什么要为你做这个狗屁工作?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And why would I do a damn thing for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.90,0:08:30.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你见过动物园的狮子吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You ever see lions at the zoo?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.87,0:08:33.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你总分辨出那些从野外抓获的...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can always tell the ones that were captured in the wild...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.74,0:08:35.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,...只要看它们的眼睛就行了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}By the look in their eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.71,0:08:40.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,天啊 你还是这套狗屁说词\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jesus Christ. You still coming with that same sorry-ass speech?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.45,0:08:42.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,起过作用吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Does it ever actually work?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.08,0:08:46.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 有时候有用 - 至少这回不行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- From time to time, yeah. - Not this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.49,0:08:49.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我这两天不怎么爱国\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not feeling too patriotic these days.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.02,0:08:51.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,所以 我不会加入你的这个小战争\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So I want no part of your little war.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.09,0:08:54.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你已经加入了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're already part of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.36,0:08:57.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,有人在杀害我们的旧战友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Somebody's taken out members of our old unit.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.46,0:09:00.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他们既然找了我 也会来找你的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They came for me. They will come for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.34,0:09:06.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你要么死在这里 要么和他们打一仗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, you can die in here, or you can take the fight to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.34,0:09:09.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我记忆中的德瑞斯总是会先出手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Darius I remember always liked to throw the first punch.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.45,0:09:15.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这些说词是新的了吧?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}New speech, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.16,0:09:24.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你在里面有自由活动吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You get any exercise in here?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.69,0:09:26.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,每天12点到1点 在院子里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Twelve to 1 every day on the yard.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.89,0:09:29.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,明天12:06\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}12:06 tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.20,0:09:32.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 德尔塔高地见 - 高地?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Bravo Delta High Sign. - High Sign?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.53,0:09:35.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,高地 就像以前一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}High Sign. Be just like old times.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.10,0:09:39.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,最好和以前不一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You better hope not.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.21,0:09:41.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,因为上次结果可不怎么好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because last time out didn't have such a happy ending.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.14,0:09:44.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你失踪了 而我进了这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You went MlA, and I ended up in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.71,0:09:46.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好了 闭嘴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, wrap it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.75,0:09:48.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,嘿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.85,0:09:51.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你的脸弄得不错 我喜欢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I like what you did with your face.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.05,0:09:53.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好了 我们走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.03,0:10:03.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,总部来了报告\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's been a report from home office.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.90,0:10:06.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,桑迪·基斯昨晚在博拉博拉岛被杀了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Xander Cage was killed in Bora Bora last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.93,0:10:08.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,博拉博拉岛?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bora Bora?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.77,0:10:11.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,为什么不能分配我到那些岛去工作?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why don't I get those assignments, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.07,0:10:14.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,吉本斯怎么样了 谁有他的消息?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What about Gibbons? Any word on Gibbons?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.27,0:10:16.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,未予说明 只知道这个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Unaccounted for. We do know this:
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.84,0:10:20.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,只有三个人能用那个电梯 而他是其中一个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He was one of only three men with access to that elevator.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.41,0:10:21.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,另外两个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The other two....
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.88,0:10:24.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,已经不能提供更多的线索\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ain't gonna be giving us much of a statement.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.75,0:10:29.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好的 全面调查吉本斯先生 盯紧点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, put Mr. Gibbons on the wire. Full recon. Wrap it tight.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.46,0:10:33.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,A区犯人进入练习场\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A-Block to exercise yard.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.53,0:10:35.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,A区犯人进入练习场\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A-Block to exercise yard.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.53,0:10:41.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,溜狗时间到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Time to take the dog out for a walk.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.85,0:10:59.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,知道吗...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.12,0:11:01.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 我真的会很想你们的 小伙子们 - 什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- ...I'm gonna really miss you boys. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.13,0:11:15.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 关掉所有的门! - 犯人 趴下!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Secure all doors! - Prisoner, stand down !
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.84,0:11:19.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 六级戒备! - 把援助找来!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Level six, lockdown ! - Get backup up here!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.64,0:11:21.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,犯人 趴下!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Prisoner, stand down !
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.68,0:11:27.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,抓住他!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get him !
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.32,0:11:33.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 洗衣房! 西面的门 - 马可!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Laundry! West door! - Marco!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.05,0:12:08.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,瞄准好了250码\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Got him. Two hundred and fifty yards.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.89,0:12:11.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他要去哪儿? 他不可能靠近墙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where's he gonna go? He's nowhere near the wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.50,0:12:19.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好了 兄弟!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, man !
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.86,0:12:47.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 抓住他! - 抓住!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Get him ! - Hold it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.03,0:12:49.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,回来!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come back!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.99,0:13:18.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你们迟到了!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You were late.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.86,0:13:22.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你确定是这样子接人吗 长官?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You sure know how to pick them, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.10,0:13:26.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这个家伙是谁?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who the hell is this guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.63,0:13:28.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,文官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Civilian contractor.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.47,0:13:31.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,等他醒过来的时候 我们早走了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}By the time he wakes up, we'll be long gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.08,0:13:41.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 你说了是12:06 - 遇到气流\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You said 12:06. - Hit some turbulence.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.55,0:13:44.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 我们有大号和超大号 - 你是谁 男管家?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We got large and extra large. - Who are you, the butler?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.69,0:13:46.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,托比·李·杰弗 华盛顿技术分部\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Toby Lee Shavers, D.C. Tech Division.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.65,0:13:49.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 德瑞斯·斯通 监狱A区 - 再也不是了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yeah. Darius Stone, cellblock A. - Not anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.36,0:13:51.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,德瑞斯·斯通不存在了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Darius Stone no longer exists.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.63,0:13:53.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 那我是谁? - 你是新的XXX\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Well, who the hell am I? - You're the new XXX.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.96,0:13:55.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,听上去像是演A片儿的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sound like a porno star.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.53,0:13:57.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 那原来的XXX呢? - 死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What happened to the old XXX? - He's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.93,0:14:01.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,XXX是我们给身怀绝技的卧底特工起的名字\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}XXX is the designation we give to deep-cover agents with special skills.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.97,0:14:04.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好吧 随便了先说重点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, whatever. First things first.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.30,0:14:06.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我在里面待了很长时间了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've been on the inside a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.61,0:14:09.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我需要任何一个刚从监狱出来的男人都要的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need what every man needs when he's coming off of lockdown.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.61,0:14:11.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你知道我的意思吧?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know what I'm saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.65,0:14:17.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是的 宝贝 你老爸是谁? (饿得什么都不顾了)\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, baby. Who's your daddy?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.59,0:14:25.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你确定他是你要的人吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You sure we got the right guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.36,0:14:28.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,嘿 伙计! 再来份薯条和奶昔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, buddy, more fries and another shake.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.26,0:14:29.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这就来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.53,0:14:35.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 开工了 - 我再要点薯条和奶昔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We need to go to work now. - I need more fries and another shake.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.70,0:14:38.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,嘿 你现在是在为我们干活\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, you work for us now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.47,0:14:40.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 所以你要... - 我想什么时候干活 就什么时候干\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- So you're gonna do... - What I want when I want.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.01,0:14:44.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,看好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.31,0:14:48.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我现在筋疲力尽 你们在那儿就违反了十条联邦法律\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...by my count, you boys just broke about 10 federal laws back there.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.65,0:14:51.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,协助罪犯逃跑 藏匿罪犯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aiding and abetting, harboring a fugitive...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.39,0:14:53.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,还有我喜欢的偷窃直升机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and my personal favorite, grand-theft chopper.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.36,0:14:57.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 那你的意思是? - 你们两个...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- So, what's your point? - That you two...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.76,0:15:03.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,...现在是在"玩火"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...are looking at three strikes and the inside of a very small cell.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.46,0:15:06.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 不要抢我的台词 - 现在我是主角\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You know that's my speech. - I'm running the show now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.90,0:15:09.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,咱们说好了我不会听你的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So here's the deal : I don't answer to you...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.57,0:15:12.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,当然也不会听这个学生愣头青的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and I damn sure don't answer to college boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.21,0:15:13.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,学生愣头青?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}College boy?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.01,0:15:16.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Done.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.51,0:15:20.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,付账\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pay the man.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.21,0:15:24.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好 我们已经知道你会打架和吃饭 你还会什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay. So we know you can fight and eat, but what else can you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.48,0:15:28.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,上一个XXX会滑雪 会冲浪 还有各种绝活\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The last XXX, he could ski, surf, do all kinds of stunts.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.39,0:15:30.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但是他死了 不是吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, he's dead now, isn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.29,0:15:32.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,现在情况不一样了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So things are gonna be different around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.53,0:15:34.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,因为我不会拿自己的命开玩笑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because I don't play with my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.26,0:15:37.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 要冒险 也先用你们的小命 - 我们得回华盛顿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'd rather play with yours. - We gotta get back to D.C.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.17,0:15:40.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们需要找个地方躲一阵儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We need a place to lay low.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.70,0:15:44.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我知道一个最安全的地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know the safest place in town.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.92,0:16:02.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这就是最安全的地方?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is the safest place in town?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.47,0:16:10.54,Default,NTP,0,0,9,!Effect,(神殿剧场)
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.54,0:16:18.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,别动 我会处理的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stay put. I'll handle this.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.30,0:16:54.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,德瑞斯·椎·斯通\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}D-Train Stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.04,0:16:57.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,怎么样啊? 我听说 他们把你关在...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Heard they had you locked down in the deepest hole...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.68,0:16:59.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,大峡谷最深的地洞里了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...this side of the Grand Canyon.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.41,0:17:02.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,大概我表现太坏 所以他们不得已把我放了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, they let me out early for bad behavior.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.75,0:17:05.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 伙计 真的是有一阵了 - 老板在哪儿 我要跟她谈谈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Man, it's been a while, D. - Where's the boss? I need to talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.09,0:17:09.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你走了以后 很多事情都变了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Man, a lot's been changing since you left, D.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.62,0:17:11.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我现在是老板了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I run the chop shop now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.86,0:17:16.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 罗拉去哪里了? - 市郊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Where's Lo? - Uptown.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.33,0:17:18.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,市郊?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uptown?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.84,0:17:24.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,现在 这儿更象市郊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, this is more like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.27,0:17:25.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,欢迎到西部 X\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Welcome to the west side, X.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.87,0:17:28.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,要想混出名堂 就得入乡随俗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You wanna run in these circles, you're gonna have to blend.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.01,0:17:30.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我从不随俗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't blend.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.92,0:17:40.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,法拉利的迪诺车 力矩线大概在6400转每分钟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Dino has the torque curve dropping off around 6400 rpm.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.92,0:17:44.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,把喷射器的脉冲增加到10%\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dial down the injector pulse width by about 10 percent.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.89,0:17:47.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,试试20\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Try 20.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.37,0:17:54.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,德瑞斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Darius.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.17,0:17:56.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你看上去老了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You look older.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.67,0:17:59.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,吃九年牢饭你也会这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nine years of bad food will do that to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.67,0:18:01.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,九年了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nine years.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.41,0:18:06.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,要是我说错了 请指正 你是不是想回避20岁?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, correct me if I'm wrong, but isn't that a few years shy of 20?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.05,0:18:09.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,干脆你直接说你要什么吧 这样我们能快点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just tell me what you need so we can do this and be done.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.05,0:18:12.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那才是你来的原因 对吧? 你到底需要什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That is why you're here, right? You need something.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.99,0:18:15.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,热水澡 还有个地方睡一觉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hot shower, place to crash.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.96,0:18:21.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,德瑞斯 看看四周\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look around, Darius.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.23,0:18:24.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我在这儿的生活不错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've got a good life here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.76,0:18:28.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我这次不会让你破坏我的生活的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I'm not gonna let you wreck it this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.00,0:18:30.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.57,0:18:34.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,需要我干什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...what's in it for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.88,0:18:37.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,67款GTO汽车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}'67 GTO.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.78,0:18:41.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,1000马力的 特殊悬浮系统\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thousand horsepower, crate motor, trick suspension.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.98,0:18:43.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 什么? - 他说的是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What? - He's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.38,0:18:47.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 他们会找它的 - 另外 我们还需要...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- They'll be looking for it. - Besides, if we're gonna roll...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.29,0:18:50.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,一个有力量的东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...we're gonna need something with a little more muscle.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.09,0:18:52.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,有威胁的(与"淫荡"同音)\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Something nasty.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.69,0:18:55.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这个我可以哦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can do nasty.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.03,0:18:57.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我知道你办得到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.13,0:19:01.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,加粗倾斜滚珠轴承 8升油缸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bored and stroked, full roller, 8 liters.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.97,0:19:06.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,每平方英尺25磅的增压器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Supercharged with a 25-psi boost, automated hydraulics...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.71,0:19:10.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,自动液压系统 带变速箱 你觉得如何?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...high-stall converter with shift kit. That gonna do the trick?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.21,0:19:12.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 你满意啦? - 不错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You happy? - I'm good.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.41,0:19:14.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我喜欢这姑娘\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I love this girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.52,0:19:27.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,目标? 就是情报\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, the target is information.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.93,0:19:31.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,在我以前那个司令部的硬盘上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}lt's on a hard drive inside my old headquarters, here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.87,0:19:33.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,剩下的在我家里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The rest of it is at my house.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.63,0:19:35.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 我今晚拿给你 - 信息?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'll pick that up tonight while you... - lnformation?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.10,0:19:37.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,先给我点信息啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, start by giving me some.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.51,0:19:41.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 我们知道的一样多 - 你知道我指的是什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We on the same page? - You know what I'm talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.78,0:19:44.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,上一次我被捕 可是你消失了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Last time out, I went down, and you disappeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.61,0:19:47.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,听着 那天不只是你有损失\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, you aren't the only one who lost something that day.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.45,0:19:50.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,当时起火了 而你正忙着和将军交战\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When the fire started, you were busy with the general.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.02,0:19:54.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们中的一些人就冲进去了 看还能救出谁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Some of us went in to see who we could save.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.35,0:19:58.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,现在你觉得这样不好了? 你应该看看我收拾完之前的烂摊子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, you think this looks bad? You should've seen it before I got it fixed.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.24,0:20:11.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,看来大概没有谁的经历是愉快的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Guess nobody's story has a happy ending.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.54,0:20:13.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这一切都还没结束呢 大兵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Story's not over yet, soldier.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.74,0:20:15.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,杰弗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shavers...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.38,0:20:18.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你能把这个改装成单兵用枪吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...can you make that into a personal weapon?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.28,0:20:21.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,给我一个小时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give me an hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.18,0:20:26.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 我们之间还有问题吗? - 上校 很有趣的是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We straight? - lt's funny, captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.25,0:20:29.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,战争打打停停 而我的战士们却是永恒不变的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wars come and go, but my soldiers stay eternal.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.19,0:20:32.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我喜欢这句话 是谁说得来的?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I like that. Who said it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.79,0:20:35.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 杰弗逊? 巴顿将军? - 图帕克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Jefferson? Patton? - Tupac.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.41,0:20:51.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好吧 X 这是一次绝密行动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, X, this is a covert op.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.51,0:20:53.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,绝对机密\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Full stealth, total silence.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.51,0:20:56.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你一定要非常仔细\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're gonna wanna be real delicate here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.86,0:21:04.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,精巧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Subtle.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.73,0:21:08.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,非常精巧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Very subtle.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.66,0:21:10.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这是14区\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is sector 14.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.43,0:21:12.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,上面被袭击了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We got an attack, topside.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.20,0:21:17.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你们两个守住这一层 其他人跟我走!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You two, hold the floor. Everybody else, follow me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.18,0:21:25.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好的 X 你有三分钟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, X, you got three minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.02,0:21:38.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,X 吉本斯的办公室在西北角第四区\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}X, Gibbons' office is northwest corner, sector four.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.56,0:21:45.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,喂 等等!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey! Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.07,0:21:52.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,X 主房间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}X, main room.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.41,0:21:54.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,取出面朝你的三个硬盘的第一个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Remove the first of three drives facing you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.82,0:22:03.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这里没人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's nobody here.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.28,0:22:04.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,除了所有我们的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, except for all of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.05,0:22:08.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这不是袭击 是调虎离山\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}lt wasn't an attack, it was a diversion.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.29,0:22:12.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好了 X他们回来了 你必须离开! 快!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, X, they're coming back down. You gotta go. Now.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.42,0:22:40.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,包围这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lock this place down.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.95,0:22:42.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,要活捉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want him in hand, alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.76,0:22:45.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,大学生小子! 我被截住了! 把我弄出来!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}College boy, I'm cut off. Get me out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.36,0:22:48.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好的 X 去码头 前面1/4英里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, X. Boat dock, quarter mile, dead ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.07,0:22:53.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,截住那卡车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want that truck.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.73,0:22:56.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,封锁方圆十英里以内的每条道路\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Block every road in a 10-mile radius.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.87,0:24:06.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,有人受伤吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everybody okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.44,0:24:09.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我车丢了 船也没了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Blows up my car, he blows up my boats.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.34,0:24:11.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这家伙到底是谁?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who the hell is this guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.15,0:24:19.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好啦 大学生小子我正在笔直朝前赶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, college boy, I'm headed upstream.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.92,0:24:23.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,X 我这儿出了点小状况\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}X, got a little bit of a problem here.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.29,0:24:24.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,有警察!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is the police.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.12,0:24:27.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,妈的 你的任务不过是开开车而已\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Goddamn ! All you had to do was drive.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.73,0:24:30.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你知道吗 X 我真的开始想念以前的XXX了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know what, X? I'm really starting to miss the old XXX.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.76,0:24:33.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,马上停车!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop your vehicle now.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.20,0:24:35.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好的 我看见你了!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, I see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.05,0:24:52.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,从驾座上滚开!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, get your ass out the driver's seat.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.59,0:25:30.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,任务完成\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mission accomplished.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.16,0:25:39.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,德瑞斯·斯通 出生在华盛顿南部 早年丧母 由父亲养大成人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Darius Stone. Born south side, D.C. Mother died young, father raised him.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.97,0:25:41.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,生活很普通 一直到1988年\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not much to report till '88.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.87,0:25:45.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他的父亲被街头流弹打死 然后德瑞斯就不上学了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}His dad was killed by a stray bullet in a 211, and Darius went off the grid.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.17,0:25:48.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,开始是小偷小摸 野蛮驾驶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Started with graffiti, reckless driving.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.61,0:25:52.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,因为偷车拘捕被抓\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Quickly worked his way up to grand-theft auto and resisting arrest.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.18,0:25:55.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,过了一段时间以后 他参加了海军 如鱼得水\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Took him some time to find his calling in the Navy.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.25,0:25:57.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,特别是在加入美国海军特种部队以后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Specifically, the Navy SEALs.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.32,0:26:01.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,受训成为狙击手 成绩优异 擅长城市作战 爆破\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Trained sniper, top scores. Urban recon, demolition.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.29,0:26:05.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,保持海军最高潜水纪录250英尺\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The highest dive in Navy history, 250 feet.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.53,0:26:08.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,奥古斯塔斯·吉本斯招他入了精英组\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Augustus Gibbons recruited him into an elite unit, Level 5 Classified.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.06,0:26:12.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,特选到科索沃执行任务 一年圣诞节\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ran ops in Eastern Europe till Christmas in Kosovo.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.13,0:26:16.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他们的将军下令放火来铲除平民\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Their general ordered them to set a fire to clear civilians...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.54,0:26:19.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但是斯通拒绝执行 并领导了对这位四星将军的兵变\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...but Stone refused. Led a mutiny against a four-star general...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.91,0:26:22.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,而这个将军就是现任国防部长乔治·德克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...the current secretary of defense, George Deckert...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.64,0:26:24.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他使斯通被判了20年刑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...who had him court-martialed for a 20-year term.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.04,0:26:27.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,十年因为违抗军令\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ten for disobeying direct orders...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.21,0:26:29.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,十年因为被斯通打坏了下巴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and another 10 for breaking the general's jaw.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.48,0:26:32.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这是他最近的录像\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is the last footage we have on him.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.42,0:26:35.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,和他的律师乔纳森·爱德华·卡伦的会面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A meeting with his lawyer, Jonathan Edward Cochran.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.70,0:26:37.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真有意思\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, that's cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.83,0:26:39.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,强尼·卡伦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Johnnie Cochran.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.67,0:26:43.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我可不认为斯通先生能付得起强尼的律师费 我们有录音吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't think Mr. Stone can afford Johnnie's fee. Do we have audio?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.80,0:26:45.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,律师会面 不能录音\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}lt's attorney-client. No mikes.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.67,0:26:47.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,停 倒回去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold it there. Okay, reel it back.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.71,0:26:50.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,倒 倒 倒 停\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Back, back, back. Freeze it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.18,0:26:52.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,放大\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Blow it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.81,0:26:57.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,吉本斯和斯通卷土重来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gibbons and Stone on a comeback tour.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.65,0:27:01.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好的 听好 我要你们全力以赴看好这两个人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, listen up. I want all eyes up and running on these two.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.85,0:27:04.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,而且我要你们调查他们的旧部属\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I want hard 20s on the rest of their old unit.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.52,0:27:05.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我要知道他们在哪儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wanna know where they are...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.16,0:27:09.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我要知道他们在干什么 我现在就要 越快越好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...I wanna know what they're doing, and I wanna know now.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.18,0:28:40.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我很失望 奥古\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm disappointed, Auggie.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.55,0:28:43.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,三步之内将你的军?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Checkmate in three?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.66,0:28:45.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你本该预料的到的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You should've seen it coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.23,0:28:52.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,放轻松 喝一杯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Relax. Have a drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.83,0:28:57.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 我冒昧自己倒了些 - 你从来不懂得客气\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I took the liberty of pouring myself... - You were always taking liberties.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.20,0:29:00.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你还是老样子啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Same old Gibbons.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.54,0:29:02.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,坏脾气的好军人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good soldier with a bad attitude.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.98,0:29:07.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你知道吗 我一直记得我们第一次见面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, I always remember the first day we met.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.18,0:29:09.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我会记得我们最后一次的见面!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I remember the last day I saw you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.72,0:29:13.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我敢打赌你一定会的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I bet you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.86,0:29:18.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,还没痊愈 是吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Didn't heal too well, did it?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.26,0:29:21.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,有些伤口永远好不了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Some wounds never do.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.63,0:29:25.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 我从来没要你冲进那场大火 - 是没有 你只是坐在那儿看着它烧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I never asked you to go into that fire. - You just set it and watched it burn.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.70,0:29:27.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们只不过做了我们该做的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We did what needed to be done.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.53,0:29:29.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这就是你的说词? 做我们该做的事?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is  that what you call it? "Doing what you need to do"?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.10,0:29:34.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我的人死了十六个 怎么回事 只是因为一起无恶意的大火吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sixteen of my men killed? What's that, just more friendly fire?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.38,0:29:39.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,总要有人舍身取义\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Some men die so others may live.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.08,0:29:42.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,可笑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Funny...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.65,0:29:45.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,舍身的从不是你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...that you never seem to be the one doing any of the dying.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.58,0:29:49.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,只要能最好的保卫这个国家 我什么都肯做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll do whatever it takes to best protect this nation.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.59,0:29:53.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你这样做不是在保卫国家 你是在保卫你自己!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're not protecting the nation. You're doing this to protect yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.26,0:29:56.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 什么? 你现在正在进行什么样的战争? - 我们都生活在同样的世界\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Why? What fires you starting now? - We both live in the same world.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.00,0:29:59.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 我们知道外面的世界是什么样的 - 别浪废你的吐沫了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We know what's out there. - Save the speech.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.73,0:30:02.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,告诉你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just so you know...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.84,0:30:06.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不管你想干什么 你都别想逃脱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...whatever you're up to, you're not getting away with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.94,0:30:08.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,怎么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.54,0:30:11.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,因为德瑞斯会阻止我?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because Darius Stone is gonna stop me?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.28,0:30:13.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,请原谅我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.15,0:30:17.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我是不是应该很吃惊?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Was that supposed to be a surprise?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.18,0:30:19.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,吉本斯 你的每一招我都料到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gibbons, I know every move you make even before you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.09,0:30:22.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不管知道不知道 你都是在给我卖命!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You still work for me, whether you know it or not.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.39,0:30:25.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我从不为你卖命!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I never worked for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.39,0:30:28.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 我为国家卖命 - 不知道哪个更可悲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I work for my country. - I don't know what's more pathetic...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.10,0:30:30.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,一个跟自己下象棋的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...a man that plays chess with himself...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.06,0:30:33.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,还是一个不知道自己已经输了的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...or a man that doesn't see he's already lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.77,0:30:41.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,制造成一个意外 不要泄露机密\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Make it look like an accident. Zero exposure.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.31,0:31:15.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,长官 他们找到了吉本斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sir, they found Gibbons.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.98,0:31:20.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,"调查人员称这是一起明显的 煤气泄漏导致的大爆炸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}lnvestigators say an apparent gas leak triggered the explosion.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.75,0:31:23.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,消防人员未能及时救出住户\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The fire department was too late to save the occupant...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.78,0:31:26.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但是及时遏制了火势蔓延\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...but managed to contain the fire before it spread.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.52,0:31:29.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,死亡者奥古斯塔斯·吉本斯是前海军上校\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The deceased, Augustus Gibbons, was a former Navy captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.12,0:31:31.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,享年51岁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He was 51 years old.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.92,0:31:34.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,葬礼将于明天举行 地点是阿林顿国家公墓\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The funeral's tomorrow at Arlington National Cemetery.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.49,0:31:36.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,煤气泄漏 对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gas leak. Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.53,0:31:40.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这里是MJLA电视台的 利萨·乔伊纳带给您的报道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is Lisa Joyner reporting from Chevy Chase, Maryand for WJLA.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.20,0:31:42.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,切回演播室\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Back to you in the studio.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.77,0:31:45.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,托比 开始干活吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Toby, let's get to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.88,0:31:52.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,里面什么都没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's nothing on here. Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.28,0:31:54.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,没有是空的 伙计\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}lt's blank, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.21,0:31:56.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,因为你找错地方了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because you're looking in the wrong place.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.88,0:31:59.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,吉本斯说就在硬盘上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gibbons said it was on the hard drive.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.52,0:32:03.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你在干什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.10,0:32:13.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我读过关于这方面的东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I read about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.03,0:32:15.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,冷战时的老花招了 对吧?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cold War. Old school, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.00,0:32:17.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不是那个时候的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not that old school.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.00,0:32:29.70,Default,NTP,0,0,9,!Effect,(查理 六月24号 星期三 参议院会议 MTS部)
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.02,0:32:31.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.95,0:32:34.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那谁是查理?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, which one's Charlie?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.79,0:32:37.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,只有一个办法才能知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Only one way to find out.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.69,0:32:40.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,瞄准!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ready. Aim.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.63,0:32:41.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,射击!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.56,0:32:45.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,准备 瞄准 射击!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ready. Aim. Fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.00,0:32:48.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,持枪立正\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Order arms.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.44,0:32:59.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,正如我们的上帝和救世主\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like our Lord and savior...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.05,0:33:04.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,奥古斯塔斯·尤金·吉本斯去了...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...Augustus Eugene Gibbons died in our service.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.15,0:33:09.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那是国家安全局 联邦调查局 参谋长联席会议成员 国防部部长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Head of the NSA, FBI, Joint Chiefs, secretary of state.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.26,0:33:10.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,妈的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Damn.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.79,0:33:12.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你知道这意味着什么 对吧?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know what this means, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.73,0:33:14.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 什么? - 他们下一个就要杀我了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What? - They're gonna kill me next.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.53,0:33:17.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 把望远镜给我 - 妈的 伙计\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Give me those. - Damn, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.90,0:33:20.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,如果我们在一起合作 你就要稍微改变一下你的态度 像个搭档的样子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If we're working together, you should work on your partner skills.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.10,0:33:24.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,比如你要什么东西 要说 能否请你 借给我那个东西?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like, if you want something, try "Please," "May I borrow...?"
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.60,0:33:27.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,能否请你 把望远镜借给我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please, may I borrow the binoculars...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.84,0:33:29.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不然我就打得你满地找牙?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...before I kick your teeth in?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.41,0:33:33.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好的 这是个好的开始还不错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay. See, now, that's a start. Not bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.15,0:33:39.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 德克? - 你认识国防部长德克?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Deckert? - You know Secretary Deckert?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.35,0:33:41.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,哦 对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.79,0:33:43.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们又绕回来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We go way back.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.76,0:33:47.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他恨死吉本斯了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But he hated everything about Gibbons.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.59,0:33:49.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他在这里干什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, what is he doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.50,0:33:53.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 查理 - 你找到他了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Charlie. - You found him.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.20,0:33:55.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Her.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.77,0:33:57.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 她? - 能给我套西装吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Her? - Can you get me a suit?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.24,0:34:00.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,哦 你现在想随俗了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, so now you wanna blend.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.44,0:34:32.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我听说这儿有城里最好的秋葵汤\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I hear this place has the best gumbo in town.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.24,0:34:34.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,对不起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.71,0:34:36.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我已经和别人约好了 在这儿共进午餐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm actually meeting someone for lunch.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.98,0:34:40.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,放轻松 查理 只耽误你一分钟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Relax, Charlie. This'll only take a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.55,0:34:45.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你怎么知道我的名字? 你是?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How did you know my name? Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.58,0:34:47.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们有个共同的朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have a mutual friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.59,0:34:48.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,奥古斯塔斯·吉本斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Augustus Gibbons.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.62,0:34:51.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是"曾经" 有同样的朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Had a mutual friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.52,0:34:53.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但是你还没回答我的问题呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you didn't answer my question.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.59,0:34:55.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你是?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.76,0:34:57.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我是德瑞斯·斯通\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My name is Darius Stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.10,0:34:59.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,斯通?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stone?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.23,0:35:02.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,全世界都在找你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have half the suits in this city looking for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.74,0:35:04.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你来这儿干吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why in the world would you come here?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.57,0:35:05.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,相信我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Trust me...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.07,0:35:08.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,没人会到这种地方找像我这样的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...they won't look for a guy like me in a place like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.61,0:35:13.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,无意冒犯你 不过我现在谁都不相信\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, no offense, but I don't trust anybody right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.18,0:35:17.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好 这说明我们有共同点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good. That means we got something in common.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.55,0:35:20.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,查理 很抱歉我迟到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Charlie. I'm sorry I'm so late.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.65,0:35:22.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,城市青少年会议开的久了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I had that urban-youth meeting. lt ran over.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.76,0:35:24.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我给孩子们...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're trying to set up that after-school...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.06,0:35:28.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,在课后上关于枪只指导性的课程\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...gun-instructiona program for kids and...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.19,0:35:30.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,对不起 迪克·安德鲁 国家档案登记处工作 你好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry. Dickie Ambrose, NRA. Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.13,0:35:33.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,比利·鲍勃·贝克 南部浸礼会教派兄弟会的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Reverend Billy Bob Baker, Southern Baptist Brotherhood.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.90,0:35:37.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,很高兴见到你 教士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, it's just great to meet you, Reverend.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.64,0:35:41.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,嘿 我们下个礼拜在北部有集会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, listen, we're setting up this rally upstate next week...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.41,0:35:45.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我在考虑有没有办法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and I was just wondering if there was some way we could attract...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.21,0:35:49.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,吸引像你这样有名望的美国黑人参加\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...you know, some upstanding African-Americans like yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.18,0:35:50.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,有什么建议吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You got any advice for us?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.92,0:35:54.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好的 迪克 也许你可以叫你的会员们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, Dick, perhaps you could tell your members...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.42,0:35:57.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,别再买乡村音乐 别再烧十字架\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...to stop buying country music, stop burning crosses...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.82,0:35:59.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,别再射杀黑人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and stop shooting black folks.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.16,0:36:01.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,听清楚了没?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.99,0:36:03.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,要是还不行的话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, if that don't work...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.50,0:36:06.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,就试试免费送一些食品\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...try a cookout with free food.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.47,0:36:08.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,炸薯条更好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Preferably fried.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.64,0:36:10.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,迪克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dick...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.77,0:36:14.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你不会介意我们改天再...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...would you mind terribly if we rescheduled?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.87,0:36:16.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我想那样会...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think that would be....
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.71,0:36:19.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,没关系 我有很多事干\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, that's fine. I have a lot of stuff to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.01,0:36:21.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 教士 我... - 给我打电话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Reverend, I'll... - Call me.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.08,0:36:23.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我会打电话给你 讨论这件事的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll call you about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.42,0:36:32.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你跟上校的关系是?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell me about you and the captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.83,0:36:37.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我是吉本斯的国会联系人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was Gibbons' contact on the Hill.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.50,0:36:40.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,军事行动委会的助理之一\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm an aide to the Senate Subcommittee on Military Action.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.97,0:36:42.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,军方?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Military?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.17,0:36:45.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,德克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Deckert.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.57,0:36:47.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,国防部长德克?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Secretary of Defense Deckert?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.41,0:36:50.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,什么事都瞒不过他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's not a bullet shot in the dark that he don't know about.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.94,0:36:52.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,查理 告诉我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So tell me something, Charlie.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.88,0:36:54.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你能不能帮我接近他?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can you get me close to him?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.98,0:36:57.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好吧 教士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, Reverend...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.58,0:37:00.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你能找件燕尾服穿上吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...you think you can lay your hands on a tuxedo?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.80,0:37:51.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你成功了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You made it.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.30,0:37:53.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我可从不会错过这种派对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, I never miss a party.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.44,0:37:55.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我印象中可没见你穿过那种燕尾服\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not quite the tux I had in mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.14,0:37:57.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是 我现在暂时委曲一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, but I'm blending.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.14,0:38:00.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,看到嘉宾了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You see the guest of honor?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.68,0:38:01.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那些保镖?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Those bodyguards?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.11,0:38:05.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,保镖是海军四队的 我们队一半的人都在这儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}SEAL Team Four. Half my old unit.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.35,0:38:06.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是渣滓的那一半\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And not the better half.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.89,0:38:09.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,跟他说话的那个丑将军是谁?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who's the ugly general he's talking to?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.29,0:38:12.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,杰克·皮特邦 参谋长联席会副主席\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jack Pettibone. Vice chair, Joint Chiefs.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.46,0:38:14.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 看上去不怎么开心 - 音乐的关系\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Doesn't look too happy. - Must be the music.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.13,0:38:17.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,唯一的解释\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One way to find out.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.81,0:38:36.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我真不敢相信我所听见的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I truly can't believe what I'm hearing.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.92,0:38:38.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们有三十年交情 杰克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We go back 30 years, Jack.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.72,0:38:41.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,一起玩命 一起摸爬滚打 你从未质疑过我的命令\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Same blood in the same mud, and you never questioned my command.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.92,0:38:45.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我想你肯定听说过美国国会 (国会不会坐视不理)\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I presume you've heard of the United States Congress.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.22,0:38:46.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,杰克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jack...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.79,0:38:49.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这个国家正在向错误的方向发展\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...this country is being led down the wrong path.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.56,0:38:51.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你真的觉得你能做的到 是吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You really think you can do this, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.90,0:38:53.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,就凭着几个团的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}With just a few regiments.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.63,0:38:56.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,一旦我们领头 整个军队都会跟着干\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Once we lead, the full force will follow.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.60,0:38:57.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,时间不等人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The clock is ticking.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.50,0:39:00.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不管你加入不加入\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}With or without you.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.64,0:39:02.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,三天时间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Three days.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.82,0:39:16.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他在这\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.70,0:39:34.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,黑人 白色燕尾服\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Black guy, white tux.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.52,0:39:50.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,宴会呆腻了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Had enough of the party?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.79,0:39:57.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,抓紧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.14,0:40:14.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你叫我追查他们的旧队友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You asked me to track down the rest of their old troop?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.11,0:40:17.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,其中有一半人仍在服役\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, half of them are still enlisted.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.95,0:40:21.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 另一半呢? - 离队 失踪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What about the other half? - Gone. Missing.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.62,0:40:23.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,只要是反对德克的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The same men that backed Stone against Deckert.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.86,0:40:26.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,每一个就这么消失了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Every single one of them just disappeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.54,0:40:42.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,噢 噢 等等 这是你的家吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait a minute. This is your home?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.24,0:40:46.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,对于一个参议员助理而言 干得很不错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not bad for a senator's aide.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.24,0:40:49.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我不仅仅是个参议员助理 我还是参议员的女儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not just a senator's aide. I'm also a senator's daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.75,0:40:51.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,维吉尼亚州议员詹姆士·梅华特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}James Mayweather, Virginia.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.95,0:40:54.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你老爸打算见我这样的人?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Think Daddy's ready to meet a guy like me?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.85,0:40:58.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 实际上老爸不在城里 - 真的?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Actually, Daddy's out of town. - Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.69,0:41:03.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,请不要客气 德瑞斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Make yourself at home, Darius.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.40,0:41:06.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我想你在这里生活的一定很舒服\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not a bad place to grow up, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.83,0:41:08.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,表面上是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Only on the surface.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.50,0:41:11.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,在华府政界长大 就跟成长在蛇窝一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Growing up in D.C. politics is like living in a snake pit.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.97,0:41:14.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,每个人都在为势力你争我夺\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everybody fighting for territory.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.64,0:41:16.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,听上去跟我成长的环境一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sounds a lot like where I grew up.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.41,0:41:22.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这绝对不象我成长的环境\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, no. This is nothing like where I grew up.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.75,0:41:27.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,换衣服吧 好不好?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's get you out of those clothes, shall we?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:31.39,0:41:32.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,找到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.46,0:41:35.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,试试这些\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why don't you try these on.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.79,0:41:37.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这些不是我喜欢的类型\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not really my style.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.56,0:41:42.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,何不去洗一个澡?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why don't you go ahead and get cleaned up.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:42.63,0:41:44.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,浴室有干净的毛巾\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's some fresh towels in the bathroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:45.04,0:41:46.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,全套服务 对吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Full-service, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:47.54,0:41:50.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,如果你需要任何东西的话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, if you need anything...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:50.71,0:41:53.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我就在楼下大厅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...I'm just right down the hall.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:53.81,0:41:55.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,任何东西?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:56.38,0:41:58.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,任何东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anything at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:59.22,0:42:01.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,来点儿薯条和奶昔行吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How about some fries and a shake?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:10.00,0:42:13.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,有些事可不是为国家做的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The things I can't do for my country.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:45.66,0:42:47.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,查理?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Charlie?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:58.44,0:43:00.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,查理\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Charlie.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:17.06,0:43:18.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,皮特邦?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pettibone?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.70,0:43:24.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是她设的圈套\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She set me up.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:24.50,0:43:26.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,婊子!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:29.81,0:43:31.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,警察\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is the police.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:31.71,0:43:34.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,双手放于脑后 走出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come out with your hands behind your head.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.55,0:43:38.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,参谋长联席会副主席就住在那里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We got the vice chair of the Joint Chiefs in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:38.32,0:43:40.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他在房子里面 有凶器 危险人物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The assailant is armed and dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:40.52,0:43:42.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,必须非常谨慎行事 先生们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Proceed with extreme caution, gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:43.02,0:43:46.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,找一个人质谈判专家 封锁两条街区\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gus, get me a hostage negotiator, clear a two-block radius...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:46.86,0:43:49.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 疏散周围五条街 - 最好疏散十条街\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- ...and five is the active perimeter. - Better make that 10.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:50.16,0:43:52.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,麦多上尉 这是特种部队的狙击手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Captain, the man's a Special Forces sniper.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:52.26,0:43:55.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,一定要清场 至少一英里的范围\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Keep all fields clear at least half a mile downwind.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:55.27,0:43:57.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 你到底是谁? - 国家安全局 凯尔·斯蒂尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Who the hell are you? - Kyle Steele, NSA.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:58.27,0:44:00.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,上校 我要跟这小子谈谈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Captain, I need to speak to this man alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:01.04,0:44:03.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 谈什么? - 事关国家安全 先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- So? - lt's a matter of national security, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:04.08,0:44:06.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 你到底要去哪儿? - 去里面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Where the hell are you going? - Going inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:06.58,0:44:09.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我不管你是谁 只能给你六分钟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen, I don't care who you are. You got six minutes till we breach.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:10.28,0:44:11.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,斯通!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:11.68,0:44:13.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我进来了 没带枪!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm coming in unarmed.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:19.52,0:44:21.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好吧 把门关上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, close that door.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:25.36,0:44:26.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,抬手!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:28.80,0:44:30.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,过来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Step forward.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:31.50,0:44:34.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你怎么知道你进门的时候我不会开枪?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How you know I wouldn't shoot you the second you stepped through?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:34.64,0:44:35.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:36.04,0:44:39.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但是我知道 在他们破门而入之前 你只有五分钟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I do know this: You got five minutes till they knock that door down.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:39.41,0:44:41.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,废话少说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So let's skip the chitchat.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:41.25,0:44:44.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 皮特邦在哪儿? - 楼上 死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Where's Pettibone? - Upstairs, dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:45.18,0:44:46.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 你干的? - 要是我干的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You do it? - If  I did it...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:47.12,0:44:49.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你是绝对不会知道的 除非我告诉你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...you wouldn't know until I wanted you to.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:49.42,0:44:51.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,现在 转身\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, turn around.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:54.99,0:44:57.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,斯通 情况不妙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stone, this doesn't look too good, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:57.56,0:45:00.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,国家罪犯私闯民宅 手中持枪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}An escaped convict breaks into a house with an automatic in hand...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:00.70,0:45:02.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 楼上还有个死人 - 我没有私闯过去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- ...and a dead man upstairs. - I didn't break in.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:03.13,0:45:04.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,过去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, move.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:04.80,0:45:06.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你没闯进来?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You didn't break in here?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:06.20,0:45:08.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,难道是将军请你来小睡一下?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, what, the general invited you over for a nightcap?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:08.77,0:45:11.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那么发生什么了? 你在玩枪时走火了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What happened? You guys felt like playing Russian roulette?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:11.74,0:45:13.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这不是我的枪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is not my gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:13.28,0:45:14.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,指望我会相信你的鬼话?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You expect me to buy that line?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:14.95,0:45:16.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不是鬼话 是真相\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}lt's not a line, it's the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:16.55,0:45:18.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 他们设计陷害我 - 谁?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- They set me up. - Who set you up?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:19.62,0:45:21.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 德克 - 德克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Deckert. - Deckert.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:23.76,0:45:25.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,国防部长德克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Secretary of Defense Deckert.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:26.46,0:45:28.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,当吉本斯快找到真相的时候 德克杀了他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He clipped Gibbons when he got too close.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:28.93,0:45:30.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,现在是皮特邦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And now Pettibone.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:31.63,0:45:33.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,找到什么真相?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Too close to what?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:34.57,0:45:37.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,斯通 还有3分钟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stone, we have three minutes. Level with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:37.87,0:45:40.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们为什么在这儿? 你为什么跟踪皮特邦?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why are we here? Why'd you go after Pettibone?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:40.21,0:45:42.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我谁也没跟踪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't go after nobody.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:42.51,0:45:43.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我都不认识他!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't even know the guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:44.14,0:45:45.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,以前都没见过他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Never seen him before in my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:47.85,0:45:49.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,哦 哦 放轻松\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:52.15,0:45:53.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,看上去非常象是你干的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That sure looks a lot like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:58.29,0:45:59.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,妈的 干得真绝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Damn, they're good.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:01.96,0:46:03.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,现在是吃点心的好时候吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Think now is really the best time for a snack?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:04.13,0:46:06.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,外面有三组人?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What they got out there, three teams?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:06.50,0:46:10.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,闪光弹 防弹衣 热能探测器是这样吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Flash-bangs, body armor, heat-scopes. Am I close?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:10.40,0:46:12.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,斯通 我想帮你 真的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stone, I wanna help you here, I really do.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:12.64,0:46:14.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但是 你要跑了 你就真的有罪了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But if you run, you look guilty.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:14.71,0:46:17.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,反正我长得就像罪犯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Brother, I was born looking guilty.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:17.91,0:46:19.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,现在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And now...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:19.44,0:46:21.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是你走的时候了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...it's time for you to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:23.75,0:46:25.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他在哪?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:27.29,0:46:29.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他在哪?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:29.25,0:46:32.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,上校 我找到他了 看起来他是在楼上浴室里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Captain, I got him. Looks like upstairs bathroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:32.76,0:46:34.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好的 去抓他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, go get him.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:21.94,0:47:24.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,"我们得到嫌疑犯的照片 我们知道..."\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is the last known photograph of the suspect.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:25.14,0:47:27.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 照得不错 - 是 你挺上相\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Cute picture. - Yeah. Haircut suits you, definitely.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:28.15,0:47:29.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,靠近夏洛茨维尔 维吉尼亚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...near Charlottesville, Virginia.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:29.81,0:47:32.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,"预计袭击者有武器 很有威胁性"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The assailant is assumed to be armed and dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:32.65,0:47:34.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,皮特邦将军的好友之一\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One of General Pettibone's closest friends...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:34.82,0:47:36.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,国防部长乔治·德克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}... was Defense Secretary George Deckert.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:36.92,0:47:39.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,杰克·皮特邦是我的挚友之一\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jack Pettibone was a dear friend of mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:40.13,0:47:43.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,今晚我们国家失去了一个伟大的爱国者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And tonight, this nation has lost a great patriot.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:43.96,0:47:47.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,国家也将会记住他的功勋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And his quiet contributions will be properly recorded...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:47.50,0:47:49.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他也会名垂青史\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...in history books yet to be written.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:49.37,0:47:51.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,"皮特邦将军的军队\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}From base to base, Camp Pendleton to Fort Bragg...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:52.00,0:47:53.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,为了将军的葬礼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}... General Pettibone's troops are en route...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:54.17,0:47:56.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,在华盛顿集结"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}... to Washington D. C. for the funeral.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:56.21,0:47:57.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他们不是为了葬礼而来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're not coming for the funeral.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:58.14,0:47:59.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,一丘之貉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Same blood, same mud.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:00.28,0:48:03.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,皮特邦和德克并肩作战三十年\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pettibone and Deckert both served for over 30 years together.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:03.31,0:48:05.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那你的意思是皮特邦的军队也是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So that means Pettibone's troops are also...?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:05.62,0:48:06.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 德克的 - 对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Deckert's. - Correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:07.15,0:48:08.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这跟葬礼有什么关系?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's that got to do with the funeral?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:09.05,0:48:11.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,完美的遮掩德克制定的来宾名单\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The perfect cover. Deckert does the guest list...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:11.89,0:48:13.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,只有支持他的人会来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...only invites his boys to town.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:14.49,0:48:15.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这样一来 他自己的军队就建成了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's got his army.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:16.13,0:48:19.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,现在 他肯定已经装备好了 他从哪儿得到的军火?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, he's gotta be loading up. How would he get his gear?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:19.43,0:48:21.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,只要去自己的部门就行 国防部\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All orders go through his department, the DOD.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:22.07,0:48:23.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:26.40,0:48:27.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你要我闯进去?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You want me to hack in?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:27.97,0:48:29.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,黑掉美国国防部?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To the U.S. Department of Defense?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:30.11,0:48:31.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那里有占地五百亩的硬件 超级CRAY计算机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're talking 500 acres of hardware.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:32.14,0:48:33.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,扩充的芯片\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cray supercomputers, encryption chips...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:34.11,0:48:37.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,更别说比国家安全局 中情局 国税局加起来还多的防火墙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...not to mention more firewalls than the NSA, ClA and the lRS combined.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:37.88,0:48:39.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,正是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:39.68,0:48:41.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,拿着我的薯片\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold my chips.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:56.73,0:48:58.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你不用陪我熬夜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, you don't have to wait up.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:00.07,0:49:01.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你以为我会丢下你一个人 和我的车在一起?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You think I'd leave you alone with my car?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:04.18,0:49:05.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这辆车有什么特别?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's so special about this one?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:07.91,0:49:12.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是BlT COPER原型车 六百马力 一万转\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shelby Cobra prototype, 600 horses, 10,000 rpm.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:12.92,0:49:14.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,只产三辆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Only three off the rack.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:14.69,0:49:17.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,有个议员花了五十万买了一辆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And we sold it for half a mil to some senator...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:17.19,0:49:19.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,开车从来没起超过一档\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...who'll never take her out of first gear.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:19.22,0:49:20.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,一辆车五十万?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Half a mil for a car?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:21.33,0:49:23.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你跟不上时代了 德瑞斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You been gone a while, D.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:23.43,0:49:26.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,现在什么都贵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everything's more expensive now.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:29.87,0:49:31.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这我到是看出来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I could see that.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:33.81,0:49:35.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,过来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:37.41,0:49:39.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,干得真不错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've done real good, Lo.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:39.81,0:49:43.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不用再运汽车 配零件 拆引擎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No rollbacks, part bins or stripped engines.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:43.72,0:49:45.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,从齐克的小店铺发家 你现在简直不得了了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}lt's a long way from Zeke's chop shop.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:46.65,0:49:49.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我后车厢里仍有零件\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Still got a few bins in the back.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:49.52,0:49:52.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我还经常把自己的手弄的脏兮兮的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I still get my hands dirty.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:58.86,0:50:01.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,经典就是经典\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Classic's still a classic.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:01.60,0:50:05.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,还记得我们第一次开这个车的情景吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You remember the first time we dropped gears in this one?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:05.80,0:50:09.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我记得三辆警车在林荫道上追车 速度在100码以上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I remember three squad cars at 100-plus on the parkway.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:09.77,0:50:11.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,她很快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, she was fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:12.34,0:50:14.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真的 很快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, she was.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:14.71,0:50:17.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,记得我们把后车座搞得一团糟吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You remember all that damage we did in the back seat?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:19.82,0:50:22.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,陈年旧事了 德瑞斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That was a long time ago, D.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:22.72,0:50:24.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,对我不是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:26.09,0:50:27.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,可以再来一次吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ready to do some more damage?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:30.96,0:50:33.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他成功了!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He shoots, he scores!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:34.13,0:50:37.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,大学生小子成了本世纪最牛的黑客! 这里有份正式命令\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}College boy just pulled off the hack of the century. Requisition order.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:38.14,0:50:40.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,德克准备把他所有的部队和军火\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Deckert's bringing all his troops and armored vehicles...
Dialogue: 0,0:50:40.84,0:50:44.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,都通过海军基地调到了独立号军舰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...through a naval base up the Potomac to the USS lndependence.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:44.51,0:50:47.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那可是个航空母舰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}lt's an aircraft carrier, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:47.95,0:50:49.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,看来我们要北上了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Looks like we going upstate.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:17.57,0:52:21.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,哈哈 这不是我们的小姑娘嘛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, well. Daddy's little girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:46.63,0:52:48.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,听我说 吉本斯 人们会相信...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, Gibbons, people will believe...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:48.97,0:52:50.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 斯通 - 你想我吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Stone. - You miss me?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:51.04,0:52:52.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,当然罗 我们都想念你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Apparently, we all did.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:52.94,0:52:55.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,她也让我上当了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She had me fooled too.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:55.79,0:52:57.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,上校?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Captain?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:00.59,0:53:02.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,哈里斯? 杰克森?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Harris? Jackson?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:02.93,0:53:05.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 到底怎么回事? - 是你的旧战友 斯通\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What the hell is going on here? - lt's your old unit.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:05.63,0:53:08.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你也很快会加入他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you're gonna be joining them real soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:08.90,0:53:11.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 她在说什么? - 德克我们都中了他的圈套\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What's she talking about? - Deckert. He set us up.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:12.14,0:53:14.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 为什么? - 我不知道 我还没想出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- For what? - I don't know. I didn't get that far.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:14.44,0:53:16.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我还以为你想出来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was hoping maybe you did.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:19.14,0:53:21.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 你哪儿也别想逃 - 你也一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You not going nowhere. - Neither are you.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:26.78,0:53:29.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不 不 不 别管我们!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no, no. Don't worry about us.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:29.85,0:53:31.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你应该干掉那个婊子!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know you should've killed that bitch !
Dialogue: 0,0:53:39.96,0:53:42.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 谁拉的警报? - 斯通 他在这儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Who triggered the alarm? - lt's Stone. He's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:44.04,0:53:47.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,列布 把那个家伙抓起来 然后带到这儿来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Liebo, get men fore and aft. Push him down here.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:10.73,0:54:12.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,把他揪出来 马上!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take him out now.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:13.03,0:54:14.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,封住出口!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Seal the hatch !
Dialogue: 0,0:54:31.02,0:54:33.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你可以射击了 重复一遍 瞄的准一点!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have green light. Repeat, take your best shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:34.02,0:54:37.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,噢 中士 你还没升官?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Old Sergeant Cobb. You still too dumb to make captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:37.79,0:54:40.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,斯通上尉 往日重现啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lieutenant Stone. Blast from the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:40.19,0:54:41.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我是你的斯通老爸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's "Big Daddy Stone" to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:41.79,0:54:43.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,跟我说说 坐牢的滋味还不错吧?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So tell me, how was prison?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:43.59,0:54:45.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你很快就知道了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'll find out soon enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:45.43,0:54:48.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,像你这样的嘴巴 他们会很喜欢的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And with a mouth like yours, they gonna love you on the inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:49.50,0:54:51.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,快 快 瞄准!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go, let's go. Get him.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:51.77,0:54:53.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,开火!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:00.61,0:55:02.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不好意思 是你的座驾吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, I'm sorry, was that your ride?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:02.98,0:55:05.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不是 但是你的座驾会直接送你进地狱!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, but yours is gonna take you straight to hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:08.35,0:55:09.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,装弹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Loading.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:09.99,0:55:11.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,准备\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stand by.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:14.26,0:55:15.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,开火!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:23.37,0:55:25.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 妈的! - 连边儿也没沾上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Goddamn it. - Man, that wasn't even close.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:26.00,0:55:29.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,下一步打算干什么? 把这儿全炸了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Trucks, choppers. What's next? You gonna sink the ship?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:29.41,0:55:30.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,只要你还在里面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Only if you're still on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:31.01,0:55:33.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,给自己留点东西 不然你就一无所有了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Keep this up and you ain't gonna have nothing left, hillbilly.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:36.28,0:55:37.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 上弹! - 完成!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Load. - Loaded.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:38.52,0:55:40.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们之间没完 乡巴佬\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You and I have unfinished business, homeboy.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:50.76,0:55:51.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,开火\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:57.50,0:55:59.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,行动! 好 来吧上!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Move! All right, come on. Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:09.91,0:56:11.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 嗨! - 他妈的 他在干什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hey! - What the hell is he doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:23.23,0:56:26.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你他妈的在干什么? 在那儿! 那边!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where the hell you going? Over there. That way.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:51.09,0:56:53.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,到最上边去 快!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get that tank topside now.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:56.63,0:56:58.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,快快快!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Move, move.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:59.43,0:57:01.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是B班的上飞行甲板 快!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bravo Squad to flight deck now.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:20.55,0:57:22.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,锁定目标!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Locked on.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:29.63,0:57:31.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,开火!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fire now.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:42.21,0:57:43.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,妈的!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Goddamn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:04.53,0:58:08.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,所有的潜水队马上潜水 封锁该区域\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All dive teams in the water. Lock the area down.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:08.20,0:58:10.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,一队 扫描船尾\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Zodiac One, sweep the stern.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:10.70,0:58:13.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,二队 扫描船中部右舷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Zodiac Two, starboard bow, in the midships.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:15.11,0:58:17.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,搜索船一号和二号...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Search Boat One and Search Boat Two...
Dialogue: 0,0:58:17.38,0:58:20.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,加强搜索范围 并注意码头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}... widen your radius and search the port side.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:20.34,0:58:23.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,潜水三队 报告进度\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dive Team Number Three, report any visual.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:25.45,0:58:28.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,乔治 我今晚向全国发表国情咨文\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}George, I'm addressing the nation tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:28.19,0:58:30.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,新的军事财政预算会有什么问题?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, what's the hang-up on the new military bill?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:30.62,0:58:33.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,要是你一直缩减军队 关闭基地...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, if you're reducing troops, closing bases...
Dialogue: 0,0:58:33.49,0:58:36.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,裁减国家海军局的话 会令我们的国家不堪一击\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and cutting R&D, you leave us vulnerable.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:36.19,0:58:38.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,乔治 我们需要增加国际援助\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}George, we need to increase international aid.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:38.70,0:58:41.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们必须扭转孤立局面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We need to reverse this isolationist doctrine.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:41.97,0:58:46.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,也许我们能和一些国家化敌为友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe then we can turn some of these enemies into allies.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:48.01,0:58:51.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我知道你不喜欢这一套 乔治\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know this doesn't particularly thrill you, George.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:51.64,0:58:53.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但是这会成为我留给后辈的遗产\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But this is going to be my legacy.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:54.01,0:58:57.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 先生 - 现在的问题是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Sir. - Now, the question is:
Dialogue: 0,0:58:58.58,0:59:00.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你支持我吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do I have your support?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:00.79,0:59:03.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,毫无疑问 总统先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}lt goes without saying, Mr. President.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:12.50,0:59:14.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你的电话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Call for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:14.30,0:59:16.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是关于你订的新林肯车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}lt's about the new Lincoln you ordered.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:17.20,0:59:19.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 好 - 楼下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yeah. - Downstairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:19.57,0:59:22.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你的车 一个人过来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your car. Come alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:39.76,0:59:41.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,看一眼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take a look.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:47.20,0:59:50.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 这是国会大厦的地图 - 军事地图\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- lt's a map of the Capitol. - A military map.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:50.90,0:59:53.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 上面有袭击路线 袭击目标... - 我看到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- With attack routes, targets... - I see that.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:54.84,0:59:56.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 你从哪儿得来的? - 北区\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Where'd you get it? - Upstate.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:57.04,0:59:59.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,从德克的小喽罗那儿 他们看来是想打第四次世界大战啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Deckert's little boy scouts are gearing up for World War lV.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:00.04,1:00:02.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他们有坦克 直升机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They got tanks, choppers.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:02.61,1:00:04.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 还有吉本斯 - 什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- They got Gibbons. - What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:04.88,1:00:06.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,吉本斯没死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gibbons is not dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:06.92,1:00:08.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,和一半我的旧队友关在一起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's locked up with half my old unit.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:09.02,1:00:10.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 北区? - 正确\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Upstate? - Correct.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:10.89,1:00:12.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,德克要行动了 让吉本斯背黑锅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Deckert is setting them up for a fall.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:13.39,1:00:15.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 什么黑锅? - 你觉得呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Fall for what? - What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:15.79,1:00:18.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这家伙要袭击美国国会大厦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This man is making a move on the U.S. Capitol.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:22.70,1:00:24.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,看见了吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See this?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:25.17,1:00:27.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我正在全局考虑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Map came from National Recon.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:27.41,1:00:29.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,就算德克要行动的话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, Deckert's making a move. He's running security...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:30.01,1:00:31.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,也是为今晚的国情咨文进行安全保障\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...for the State of the Union tonight.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:32.11,1:00:35.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他不是要袭击 而是要保护这些目标\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's not attacking, he's guarding these targets.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:35.45,1:00:37.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真妙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, that's beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:37.52,1:00:39.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,掩盖的真漂亮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Perfect cover.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:39.18,1:00:41.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他把他的人已经分配到位\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's got his old crew suited and booted.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:41.45,1:00:43.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这些人只会进攻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, these boys don't play defense.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:43.99,1:00:45.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不会防御\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just offense.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:50.26,1:00:51.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,证据不足\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}lt's not enough.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:51.66,1:00:53.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,要是你的猜测错误呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What if you're wrong?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:57.84,1:00:59.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我的确错了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was wrong.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:00.40,1:01:02.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我还以为你跟那些人不一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought you was more than just another suit.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:09.01,1:01:10.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,长官 安全人员名单\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sir, the security detail...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:11.18,1:01:12.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,都是前军方的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...they're all ex-military.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:12.62,1:01:13.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是 我知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, I can see that.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:14.02,1:01:16.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,所有的人都曾是吉本斯和斯通的旧战友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All of them served with Gibbons and Stone.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:19.62,1:01:22.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 应该是德克的旧部属 - 我想我们找到蛛丝马迹了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- lt's Deckert's unit. - Think we got something.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:30.20,1:01:31.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,第四次世界大战\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}World War lV.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:31.90,1:01:35.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,有什么事需要通知国防部吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anything the Defense Department needs to know?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:37.14,1:01:39.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,没有什么你不知道的 长官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sure it's nothing you don't already know, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:41.11,1:01:43.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 乔治·德克 - 德克部长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- George Deckert. - Secretary Deckert...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:43.51,1:01:44.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这是斯蒂尔特工\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...this is Agent Steele.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:45.08,1:01:47.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,凯尔 部长想看看吉本斯案子的资料\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kyle, the secretary wanted to check in on the Gibbons case.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:48.12,1:01:50.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我个人对这个案子很有兴趣\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have a personal interest in the case.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:51.46,1:01:53.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,吉本斯本是我的好友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Captain Gibbons was a friend.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:54.19,1:01:57.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我可以向你保证 我们在竭尽全力找他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, you can rest assured we're doing everything we can to find him.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:57.66,1:02:00.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 找他? - 我们还没有确认他的尸体\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Find him? - You know, we never did lD his body.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:02.80,1:02:05.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,像那样可怕的事故\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Terrible thing, accident like that.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:07.17,1:02:09.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,可能发生在任何人身上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Could happen to anyone.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:11.81,1:02:15.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,凯尔 说吧 德瑞斯·斯通对你说了什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell me, Kyle, what did Darius Stone say to you?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:16.85,1:02:19.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 不好意思 你是什么意思? - 在他消失之前\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What do you mean? - You were the last to talk to him...
Dialogue: 0,1:02:19.28,1:02:20.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你是最后一个跟他通话的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...before he got away.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:21.79,1:02:23.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他没说什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He didn't say much.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:23.75,1:02:27.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不过是一堆不着边际的阴谋论 仅此而已\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, just a bunch of wild conspiracy theories, that's all.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:28.03,1:02:29.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,听起来象是斯通的论调\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sounds like Stone.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:32.86,1:02:36.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好吧 要是你听到些什么...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, if you hear anything....
Dialogue: 0,1:02:37.94,1:02:40.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我会记下的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll know who to chase down.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:42.24,1:02:44.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,长官 能告诉我一件事吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sir, could you tell me something?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:47.48,1:02:49.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我一直在想...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've always wondered...
Dialogue: 0,1:02:49.78,1:02:52.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你是如何挑选保护总统的人?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...how do you pick the men who protect the president?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:53.42,1:02:55.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,很简单\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Simple.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:55.19,1:02:58.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 挑选我相信的人 - 象吉本斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I choose men I can trust. - Like Gibbons.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:58.82,1:03:01.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们今晚要是有他的话就好了 长官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Would've been good to have him there tonight, huh, sir?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:01.93,1:03:04.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,哦 他会在的他的精神与我们同在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, he'll be there. ln spirit.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:04.93,1:03:06.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我相信他会的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sure he will.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:06.83,1:03:08.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,祝您好运 长官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good luck, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:26.92,1:03:29.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,听上去右边的注入器比左边稀薄\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sounds like the right bank's running leaner than the left.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:30.05,1:03:33.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,要想搞定它就必须调校电控器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You wanna richen her up, you're gonna have to remap the ECU.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:35.33,1:03:37.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 很意外吗? - 是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What, are you surprised? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:37.63,1:03:39.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你好象很会修卡车啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fact you know how to tune up a truck.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:39.60,1:03:41.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我以前可不是穿这种西装工作的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't always wear a suit.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:44.03,1:03:45.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 你怎么找到的我的? - 这是我的本行 德瑞斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- How'd you find me? - lt's my job, Darius.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:46.04,1:03:48.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我很在行 聊聊?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm very good at it. Can we talk?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:57.45,1:03:58.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You were right.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:59.05,1:04:01.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,德克知道吉本斯还活着 看看这个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Deckert knew Gibbons was alive. Look at this.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:05.19,1:04:07.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,总统 副总统 白宫发言人 国务卿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}President, VP, Speaker of the House, secretary of state.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:08.03,1:04:10.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,所有的领导人 一旦干掉这些人 他就成了什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The chain of command. He takes them out, he's what?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:11.33,1:04:14.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 德克就做总统了 - 没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Deckert becomes the new president. - That's right.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:15.17,1:04:18.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 历史上最快的革命 - 是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Cleanest revolution in history. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:18.67,1:04:20.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那你还在这儿干吗? 给白宫打电话阿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why are you here? Call the White House.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:20.54,1:04:23.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不行我们不知道他的具体计划\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can't. We don't know how deep this goes.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:24.84,1:04:26.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那你的计划是?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, what's your plan?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:26.24,1:04:29.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我想我们要找外面的人来干\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Figure we gotta go outside the box on this one.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:35.09,1:04:38.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你打算找什么样的外人呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How far outside the box are you prepared to go?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:38.26,1:04:40.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,因为如果要想靠近国会大厦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because to get us close to the Capitol...
Dialogue: 0,1:04:40.22,1:04:42.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,必须找些可靠的兄弟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...we're gonna need some brothers we can trust.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:44.60,1:04:46.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,没有哪个地方比大本营更合适的了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ain't no place like home.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:59.54,1:05:01.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是不是我听错了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Man, y'all almost had me too.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:03.11,1:05:04.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,说笑 你听到了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They got jokes, man. You hear that?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:04.92,1:05:07.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 天方夜谭 - 不是说笑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- They got jokes. - No joke.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:08.15,1:05:11.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 我们需要你的帮助 - 那你们干吗不找警察?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We need your help. - So why don't you go to the police?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:11.36,1:05:13.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 不相信警察 - 这话我爱听\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We don't trust the police. - Heard that.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:14.16,1:05:16.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,拿着 宝贝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold this, baby. One second.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:16.66,1:05:18.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你知道我们都支持你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Man, you know we got your back.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:18.70,1:05:21.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但这事跟我们没任何关系\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But this ain't got nothing to do with us.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:21.20,1:05:24.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这个跟你们息息相关\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This got everything to do with you.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:24.23,1:05:27.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不是为了美国而做 是为了你自己\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't do it for the red, white and blue, do it for yourself.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:27.71,1:05:31.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,为了你可以在白宫脚下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do it for the right to hack and jack cars of the highest quality...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:31.51,1:05:34.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,偷车改车的权利\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...on the same block as the White House.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:36.65,1:05:38.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,只不过这是美国的生活方式罢了 兄弟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}lt's the American way of life, bro.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:39.55,1:05:41.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,现在 如果你要捍卫这种生活方式的话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, if you wanna protect that way of life...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:41.75,1:05:44.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你必须站出来 为它而战\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...then you gotta step up and fight for it.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:44.56,1:05:48.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,因为要是德克掌权了 你就没有自由了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because if Deckert takes over, freedom won't be free for long.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:55.07,1:05:56.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 讲得不错 - 是啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Nice speech. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:56.60,1:05:59.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不过 说到自由的那段有点肉麻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The freedom part was a bit much, though.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:02.84,1:06:06.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我有点小要求 移民局 国税局那里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got some federal heat. lmmigration, lRS.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:07.08,1:06:09.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,有几个自家兄弟被处理的不大公正\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Couple of homeboys unjustly accused.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:10.05,1:06:12.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我帮你这个忙 你帮我们?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I do this for you, you'll hook us up?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:12.38,1:06:14.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我会竭尽所能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll do what I can.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:16.65,1:06:18.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,成交\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fair enough.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:19.92,1:06:23.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好的 伙计们 调整一下状态 有活儿干\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, fellas, get your gear together. We got some work to do.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:23.23,1:06:26.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,杰克 杀手 超人杰克 柴油机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Janky, Kevlar panels. Killa, super jacks.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:26.46,1:06:28.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,拿上所有家当\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dizzle, heavy-duty roll cages.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:28.57,1:06:31.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,伙计们 出发\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Assholes and elbows, gentlemen. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:31.50,1:06:35.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,托比! 你来打理这些家伙 我们需要更好的装备\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Toby. To deal with these guys, we're gonna need some serious gear.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:35.81,1:06:37.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,看来是时候了!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, it's about time.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:37.64,1:06:39.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,天啊 我真高兴听你这么说 X\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}God, I am so glad to hear you say that, X.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:39.91,1:06:42.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我给你做了些新玩艺儿 你一定会喜欢的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got some stuff you're gonna love. Laser-scope...
Dialogue: 0,1:06:42.48,1:06:44.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,激光频锁全球追踪仪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...frequency lock, GPS autotracker.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:44.28,1:06:46.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,它可以分辨三十里以外...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This will tell you what perfume a chick's wearing...
Dialogue: 0,1:06:46.75,1:06:48.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 辣妹的香水 - 这个早晚会用得上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- ...from 30 miles away. - That'll come in handy.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:48.99,1:06:51.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,还有这些通讯干扰器 干扰发射台 电路千斤顶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So will these. Basic scramblers, jammers, circuit jacks.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:51.89,1:06:54.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,所有你需要的 这是个特殊武器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whatever you need. Now, this is the house special.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:54.32,1:06:57.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我管它叫顶级手套\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I call this one The Glove.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:57.59,1:06:58.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,没什么特别啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So does everybody else.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:59.00,1:07:03.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,当然不一样 它有电充气动吸力装置\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not everybody else has electro-charge pneumatic suction.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:03.37,1:07:05.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,开启之后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Turn this bad boy on....
Dialogue: 0,1:07:10.31,1:07:11.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,看到了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See? Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:11.81,1:07:13.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,可牢了 怎么扯都没用 喂 小心那个按钮 别...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nothing at all. Chill out with the butt... Don't.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:14.11,1:07:15.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,别...喂 喂 喂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just... Hey, hey. Hey.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:15.78,1:07:18.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,嘿 伙计 别玩了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, man. Why you gotta play around here? Hey!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:19.08,1:07:22.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们需要军火 你有什么能发射子弹的玩意儿吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We need firepower. Do you have anything that shoots bullets?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:22.32,1:07:24.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我没有但是国家安全局有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't, but Homeland Security does.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:24.52,1:07:26.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,罗拉 快把我放下来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lola. Come on, man, please.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:29.73,1:07:32.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好的 我去打个电话 看看五角大楼能不能送货\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay. I'll just call the Pentagon and see if they deliver.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:32.90,1:07:35.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你不必那么做啊 他们一直在用民用卡车...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We don't have to. They've been running weapons across country...
Dialogue: 0,1:07:36.17,1:07:37.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,运送武器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...in civilian trucks.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:37.77,1:07:39.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,民用卡车?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Civilian trucks?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:44.21,1:07:47.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 伙计 我饿了 - 五分钟前你刚吃过阿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Man, I'm hungry. - You just ate five minutes ago.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:47.68,1:07:50.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,到后面拿片干酪吃如何?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What if I go in the back and get a slice of cheese?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:50.18,1:07:52.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你才不会只吃一片呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'd stop at one slice.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:53.52,1:07:57.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,国防部要一卡车干酪干什么啊?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What does Homeland Defense need with a truck full of cheese anyway?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:57.22,1:07:59.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是啊 你从未听说过"政府牌干酪"吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You ain't never heard of government cheese?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:07.26,1:08:08.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们帮她们一把吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's give them a little assistance.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:14.24,1:08:17.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 小伙子们 你们好 - 姑娘们 热坏了吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hi, boys. - Ladies. Look like you're overheated.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:17.77,1:08:20.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 反正我们是热坏了 - 我的意思是 你们身材很火辣\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I know we are. - I mean your car.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:33.19,1:08:34.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我是不会任人宰割的!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not going out without a fight.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:35.59,1:08:37.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 他脑子有点问题 - 钥匙在卡车上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- He's retarded. - Key's in the truck.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:37.33,1:08:39.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,把车停好 因为刹车有点失灵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Move the level, because the brakes get stuck.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:40.53,1:08:42.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,嗨 联邦调查局侦探杰弗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hi, I'm Agent Shavers.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:42.53,1:08:44.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们今天要征用你的卡车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll be commandeering your truck today.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:45.04,1:08:47.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,伙计 我们绝不能让别人知道 咱们让个白人给劫了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Man, we can't let nobody know a white guy hijacked us.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:47.94,1:08:49.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,就说是75个黑人劫的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll say it was 75 black guys.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:08.39,1:09:10.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们开卡车运枪 但是他们只付运干酪的钱?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We got a truck full of guns, they pay us to haul cheese?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:10.89,1:09:13.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 不是干酪吗? - 你觉得如何 椎?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- That's not cheese? - So, what you think, D-Train?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:15.20,1:09:16.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,火力够不够?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This enough bang for you?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:18.80,1:09:20.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,上帝保佑美国\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}God bless America.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:34.52,1:09:37.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你要干掉总统 是吗 乔治?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're going to take the president out, aren't you, George?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:37.59,1:09:41.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不是 上校 是你要 我扣扳机 你顶罪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, captain, you are. They pull the trigger, you take the fall.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:41.49,1:09:43.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 没人会相信的 - 什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No one would ever believe l... - What?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:43.73,1:09:46.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,奥库斯塔斯·吉本斯总是反对派\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Augustus Gibbons always fought the system.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:46.80,1:09:49.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,在这个星期 反对演变成了叛国\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This week, that fight became a war.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:50.23,1:09:52.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他纠集了他的国家安全局旧部...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He took out his own NSA unit...
Dialogue: 0,1:09:52.80,1:09:55.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,劫走重犯...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...broke a convict out of a maximum-security prison...
Dialogue: 0,1:09:55.44,1:09:58.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,布下自己死亡假局 谋杀皮特邦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...staged his own death, ordered the murder of Jack Pettibone...
Dialogue: 0,1:09:58.61,1:10:01.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,和他的叛军们作最后一击\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and rallied his old troop of traitors for one last stand.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:01.75,1:10:03.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我会相信的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I believe it.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:03.31,1:10:05.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你知道你的问题在哪儿吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know what your problem is, Auggie?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:05.62,1:10:08.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你总是看得不够远\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've never been able to see beyond the bend.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:08.32,1:10:11.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,而你从来就只看得到自己\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you've never been able to see beyond yourself.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:14.32,1:10:16.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你已经得到你那个英雄式的葬礼了 吉本斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've had your hero's funeral, Gibbons.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:16.53,1:10:21.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,而这次 没有人会为你的死而祈祷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This time, they're gonna bury you in a pine box in an unmarked grave.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:22.70,1:10:24.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我还没死呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not buried yet.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:24.74,1:10:26.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,上校 他只是孤家寡人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's one man, captain.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:26.84,1:10:28.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,一个人能做什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What can one man do?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:53.23,1:10:55.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,德克已经封锁了所有街道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Deckert's got all the streets locked down.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:55.60,1:10:57.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,封锁了所有方向的三个街区\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Three blocks in every direction.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:57.23,1:10:59.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,有些路 他是不知道的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There are some streets he don't know about.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:59.17,1:11:00.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,在东部国会街\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}At the East Capitol and Eighth Street...
Dialogue: 0,1:11:01.14,1:11:04.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们沿后巷穿过货仓到汽车站 混入国会区\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...we use alleys and warehouses to bust out behind the Capitol.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:04.27,1:11:06.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 会有坦克等着我们的 - 我来搞定坦克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Gonna have tanks waiting. - Leave the tanks to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:07.08,1:11:08.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,只要是有轮子的 我们就能偷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If it got wheels, we can jack it.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:09.45,1:11:10.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,相信我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Trust me, daddy-o.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:10.88,1:11:12.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 好的 出发 - 好的 先生们 整装待发\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- All right, let's roll. - All right, gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:13.35,1:11:15.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是结束的重大时刻了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lock and load. Time to ride out.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:16.05,1:11:19.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,自由国家的命运 居然掌握在一群偷车贼 维修工手里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The fate of the free world in the hands of a bunch of hustlers and thieves.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:19.62,1:11:21.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,为什么今晚应该不同呢 (意思是 一直是这个样子的)\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why should tonight be any different?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:48.02,1:11:50.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,正如您所看到的 在我身后 总统刚刚到达\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As you can see behind me, the president is just arriving....
Dialogue: 0,1:11:50.92,1:11:54.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,在总统今晚将要谈到的一系列议题中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The nation is eager to hear the president's stance on pressing issues.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:54.62,1:11:56.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,新军事法案最为瞩目\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Chief among them, the new military bill.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:04.97,1:12:09.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,女士们先生们 欢迎美国总统\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ladies and gentlemen, the president of the United States.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:16.88,1:12:20.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,美国民众们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Speaker, my fellow Americans...
Dialogue: 0,1:12:20.28,1:12:23.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,今晚 我自豪地向各位宣布\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...tonight I stand before you to report...
Dialogue: 0,1:12:23.99,1:12:28.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们的国家非常强盛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...that the state of our Union is strong.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:32.66,1:12:36.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们正处在一个关键时刻 我们手中...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We are at a critical moment in our history.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:36.53,1:12:37.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nice.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:37.93,1:12:42.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,"旷课乐" X 来吧 斯蒂尔 听听"旷课乐"(一种流行音乐)\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get crunk, X. Come on, Steele, get crunk with us.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:47.81,1:12:51.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们需要勇气来重新审视\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We now need the courage to reevaluate...
Dialogue: 0,1:12:51.35,1:12:54.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,现代美国民主的进程\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...the course of modern American democracy...
Dialogue: 0,1:12:54.68,1:12:58.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,如果我们追求真正的繁荣富强\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...if we are to truly flourish and survive.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:59.99,1:13:02.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,前面好像有点小障碍\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Looks like we got a little block party up ahead.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:02.83,1:13:04.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 冲过去 - 坐好!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Go through it. - Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:16.64,1:13:19.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们必须用理解\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We must use understanding...
Dialogue: 0,1:13:21.68,1:13:23.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,和同情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and compassion...
Dialogue: 0,1:13:24.75,1:13:27.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 他们在向我们开枪! - 欢迎加入暴徒行列 学生哥\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- They're shooting at us. - Welcome to the 'hood, college boy.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:27.75,1:13:30.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,和妥协来赢得战争\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and compromise to win battles...
Dialogue: 0,1:13:34.09,1:13:36.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,而不仅仅是牺牲...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and not just the sacrifices...
Dialogue: 0,1:13:36.73,1:13:39.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,年轻人的生命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...of the lives of our young men and women.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:52.74,1:13:54.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,伙计们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fellas...
Dialogue: 0,1:13:54.21,1:13:56.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我不想插手驾驶的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...I don't mean to be a back-seat driver...
Dialogue: 0,1:13:56.75,1:14:00.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 但是那个不是死路吗? - 没有死路这回事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- ...but isn't that a dead end? - There's no such thing as a dead end.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:30.08,1:14:32.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这就是我说的意思!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, that's what I'm talking about!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:34.35,1:14:35.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,哦 妈的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:38.32,1:14:40.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,快点倒车 快!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think you might wanna back up right about now.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:45.26,1:14:46.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,快快快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go, go, go.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:49.60,1:14:50.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,大家都下车 快!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everybody out now.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:11.39,1:15:13.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 我告诉过你 他们有坦克 - 我也说了只要有轮子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I told you they'd have tanks waiting. - And I told you...
Dialogue: 0,1:15:14.09,1:15:15.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们就能偷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...if it got wheels, we can jack it.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:16.39,1:15:19.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,快! 把坦克搞定!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Move it. Get those jacks out of there.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:37.61,1:15:40.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,欢迎 这是史上第一个被劫的坦克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Welcome to the first tank-jacking in history.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:40.82,1:15:43.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们可以也必须竭尽全力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We can and must endeavor...
Dialogue: 0,1:15:43.29,1:15:47.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,战胜敌人 令他们心服口服\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...to win the hearts and minds of our enemies...
Dialogue: 0,1:15:47.42,1:15:50.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,把他们变成我们的盟友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and turn them into our allies.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:50.83,1:15:52.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,因此 美国民众\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And so, my fellow Americans...
Dialogue: 0,1:15:53.03,1:15:57.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我今晚要你们支持这个新的...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...I will ask you tonight to support this new...
Dialogue: 0,1:16:00.70,1:16:02.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 怎么了? - 总统 您必须转移\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What's going on? - We need to move you.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:02.57,1:16:05.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,待在座位上 没有特殊情况\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Remain in your seats. No cause for alarm.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:07.34,1:16:09.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好 让我们操纵这些笨蛋零件上路吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, let's put these dubs to work.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:12.92,1:16:15.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你确定你会开坦克吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You sure you know how to drive this thing?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:18.99,1:16:20.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,正在找感觉呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just trying to get a feel for her.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:22.36,1:16:24.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真过瘾! 我会习惯的!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah ! I could get used to this.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:29.03,1:16:30.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,最好有人把这个记下来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, somebody better leave a note.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:31.10,1:16:33.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好的 支开副总统\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, split off the vice president.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:33.34,1:16:37.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 你在干什么? - 例行公事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What are you doing? - Just following protocol, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:49.35,1:16:51.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,进入目标范围\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're in position.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:03.70,1:17:06.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,紧急警报\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Code red. Code red. Small-arms fire, Capitol building.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:06.60,1:17:08.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,所有作战单位立即行动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All units respond immediately.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:16.41,1:17:18.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好的 齐克坦克是你的了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, Zeke, the tank is all yours.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:19.08,1:17:20.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,嘿 你知道该怎么做吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, you know what to do.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:29.23,1:17:31.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我领队 你垫后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll take lead, you lay down cover.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:31.33,1:17:32.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,喂 喂 你说你领队是什么意思?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you mean you'll take lead?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:33.06,1:17:35.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 我才是XXX啊 - 是你 乔治?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'm XXX. - Is  this you, George?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:36.43,1:17:37.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是你干的?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you doing this?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:39.67,1:17:41.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你知不知道"叛国"这个词?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you familiar with the word "treason"?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:41.94,1:17:43.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你是杰斐逊的追随者 (独立宣言的起草人)\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're a Jefferson man.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:43.57,1:17:46.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,自由之树时常需要...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"The tree of liberty must be refreshed from time to time...
Dialogue: 0,1:17:46.68,1:17:48.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,爱国者的鲜血来灌溉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...with the blood of patriots."
Dialogue: 0,1:17:49.91,1:17:53.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,还有独裁者的引用结束\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"And tyrants." That's the end of the quote.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:54.08,1:17:56.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,只要能保证这个国家的安全强大 我什么都肯做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will do whatever it takes to keep this nation safe and strong.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:57.02,1:17:59.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,同情? 理解?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Compassion? Understanding?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:59.49,1:18:01.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你生活在什么世界?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What world are you living in?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:05.76,1:18:07.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,干掉他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get rid of him.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:08.70,1:18:10.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好的 齐克 快干! 马上!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, Zeke, do it. Do it now.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:10.97,1:18:12.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 重新装修国会啦 - 看炮!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Let's redecorate. - Fire in the hole.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:22.15,1:18:24.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,二组正后方 一组正前方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Two Team, 6 o'clock. One Team, 12.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:32.02,1:18:33.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,中士!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sergeant.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:44.80,1:18:46.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,把吉本斯带过来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get Gibbons up here.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:46.20,1:18:48.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,收到 正在路上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Roger that. We're on our way.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:49.17,1:18:50.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,让我们结束这一切\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's finish this.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:02.75,1:19:05.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 枪法挺准 - 海豹队第一神枪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Good shooting. - Navy SEALs. High scores, Coronado.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:06.06,1:19:07.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,别吹了 我才是纪录保持者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please. I got high score.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:07.66,1:19:10.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,1996年被我破了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I beat them in '96.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:10.56,1:19:12.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,怎么 你不读新闻?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What, you don't read the newsletter?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:12.40,1:19:15.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,从礼堂西南方切入 三十秒后与你会合\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're coming in from the southwest halls. We'll be with you in 30...
Dialogue: 0,1:19:22.91,1:19:24.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,放下枪!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Drop it!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:24.77,1:19:26.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,快! 我说了 放下枪!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now! I said, drop it.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:35.29,1:19:37.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你他妈怎么这么慢才过来?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What took you so damn long to get here?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:37.72,1:19:40.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,还是老样子也许我该把它贴回去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Same old Gibbons. Maybe I should put this back on.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:41.32,1:19:45.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,"谢谢""见到你很高兴 斯通" 这样的话一句也没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't get a "thank you" or a "happy to see you, Stone" or nothing.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:49.67,1:19:52.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,看到了? 早就告诉你该干掉这个婊子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See? I told you you should have killed that bitch.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:56.17,1:19:57.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,干得好! 干得好!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bravo to Sub Team. Bravo to Sub Team.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:57.94,1:20:00.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,只要有吉本斯 我们依然能赢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We can still make this work if we have Gibbons.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:00.28,1:20:02.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,查理 你到底在哪?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Charlie, where the hell is he?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:02.35,1:20:03.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,将军 我就在这儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm right here, general.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:03.75,1:20:06.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,三步之内将你的军 你本应该预见得到的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Checkmate in three. You should have seen it coming.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:06.82,1:20:10.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,趁你还来得及 投降吧 乔治 游戏结束了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give up while you still can, George. lt's over.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:11.12,1:20:12.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,事情没有按照计划发展 是吧?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Things not going according to plan?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:17.53,1:20:18.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,长官?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sir?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:18.93,1:20:20.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,中士 沿侧面走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sergeant, sidearm.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:20.76,1:20:22.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们撤退到火车上去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll fall back to the train.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:26.97,1:20:30.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,将军 他一定有个备用计划 会是什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Captain, he's got to have a backup. What would it be?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:32.01,1:20:33.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,地下三层有为紧急撤退准备的...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's a presidential bullet train...
Dialogue: 0,1:20:33.88,1:20:36.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,总统专用子弹头火车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...three stories down for emergency evacuation.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:40.05,1:20:41.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,追过去 我们处理这边!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go after him. We'll take care of this.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:17.15,1:21:19.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 中士? - 你 你 下去!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Sergeant. - You, you, out.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:19.49,1:21:21.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,照他的命令做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do what he says.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:23.89,1:21:25.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:25.96,1:21:27.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,开车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Drive.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:36.24,1:21:38.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我告诉过你 我需要一个超级快车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Toby, I need a ride. Something fast.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:44.65,1:21:47.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,听着 派三架黑鹰来 快!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen up. I want three Black Hawks on that pad, ASAP.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:47.72,1:21:49.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,清除道路 我要车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Clear the road. I got a car incoming.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:49.79,1:21:51.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不要让其它人进入大厦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stay clear of the building.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:51.45,1:21:53.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,只有警卫和军队的人才可以进来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Only security and military personnel may enter.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:54.09,1:21:57.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是最后一击的时候了 中尉 抓住他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Time to throw the last punch, lieutenant. Go get him.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:04.63,1:22:06.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,听说你要辆车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Heard you needed a ride.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:08.94,1:22:12.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,所有的平民们 请留在原来的岗位上 直到所有的警报结束\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All civilians, remain where you are until cleared by security detail.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:12.81,1:22:14.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,她有多快?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How fast does she go?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:14.51,1:22:16.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你来告诉我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let me know.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:26.92,1:22:30.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 喂! - 斯蒂尔! 火车往哪儿开?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yeah? - Steele, where's that train going?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:30.23,1:22:33.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 西北 直上州际95... - 收到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- North-northwest. Straight up l-95. - Got it.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:33.36,1:22:35.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 德瑞斯 等一下! - 他不会等的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Darius, wait a... - He's not a big fan of waiting.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:36.10,1:22:37.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我也不会 我们走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Neither am l. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:41.33,1:23:42.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,在那儿!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There it is.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:46.27,1:23:47.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,再靠近点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, get me closer.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:56.31,1:23:58.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,再快点!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Faster.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:07.89,1:24:10.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,坐下 吉姆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sit down, Jim.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:11.43,1:24:14.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,感觉不错 是吧? 打人的感觉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Feels good, doesn't it? To get your hands dirty?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:14.43,1:24:15.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,操你妈的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fuck you.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:19.47,1:24:22.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好吧 我们看看值五十万美金的家伙能做到怎样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, let's see what half a million buys.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:46.30,1:24:48.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我没法瞄准!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't get a clean shot.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:48.26,1:24:51.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你不能 但他能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe you can't, but he can.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:55.67,1:25:59.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他们追来了 乔治 你没地方躲了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They'll just keep coming, George. There's no way you're gonna hide.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:59.27,1:26:03.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,为什么我要躲起来? 躲一个试图要救总统 却失败了的人?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why should I hide? The man that tried to save the president but failed?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:03.94,1:26:05.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我会被视为爱国者的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll be seen as a patriot.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:06.68,1:26:08.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,试着要救总统 你是说...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Tried to save the president but..." You mean...?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:08.98,1:26:10.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,国家的悲剧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A national tragedy.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:11.01,1:26:14.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这样看吧 你死后 说不定还会有个国家纪念日\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look at it this way: You might get your own holiday.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:45.74,1:27:48.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,嘿 你需要点个火\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hillbilly, you need to lighten up.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:55.38,1:27:59.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 手动刹车坏了 我没法减速 - 那我们就再也不需要你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Brakes are blown. I can't slow down. - We won't be needing you anymore.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:03.56,1:28:05.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,行动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Move.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:20.68,1:28:23.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 好的 准备好了! - 好的 开始行动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Okay, ready. - All right, here we go.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:37.39,1:28:39.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,丢下武器 踢过来 上尉!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Drop and slide, lieutenant.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:39.23,1:28:41.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,没门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:58.78,1:29:00.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,没法稳定控制\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can't hold it steady.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:01.88,1:29:03.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,趴下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Down.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:08.12,1:29:09.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,跟以前一样 是吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just like old times, huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:10.03,1:29:12.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是的 你的下巴怎么样 将军?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. How's that jaw, general?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:12.63,1:29:15.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我每次嚼东西的时候 都会想起你 斯通!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think of you every time I chew steak.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:18.67,1:29:21.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,而我在监狱里的每个晚上都会想起你!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I thought of you every night I spent in prison.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:32.82,1:29:34.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,走! 快跑!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go! Run !
Dialogue: 0,1:29:44.06,1:29:45.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,长官...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sir...
Dialogue: 0,1:29:46.26,1:29:47.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你必须跳!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...you're gonna have to jump.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:20.10,1:30:21.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,快进去了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Almost in.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:31.07,1:30:32.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我等这一天等了十年!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've been waiting for this for 10 years.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:36.55,1:30:38.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那就继续等吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, keep waiting.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:45.55,1:30:47.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是你为国牺牲的时候了 将军\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your turn to do the dying, general.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:37.37,1:31:42.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,战争打打停停 而我们的战士却是永恒不变的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wars come and go, but my soldiers stay eternal.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:42.38,1:31:44.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你说什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's that you said?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:45.01,1:31:48.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好像有人该得到总统您的嘉奖 先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Looks like there's a man who deserves a presidential commendation, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:48.65,1:31:50.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:50.89,1:31:52.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是有人该得\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And then some.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:52.49,1:31:54.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:54.39,1:31:56.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是有人该得\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And then some.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:15.41,1:32:18.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,"今天国家一片震惊...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The nation is in shock today in the aftermath of last night's....
Dialogue: 0,1:32:18.65,1:32:21.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,昨晚国会大厦遭到武装袭击...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The assault on the Capitol has reverberated around the world....
Dialogue: 0,1:32:21.75,1:32:24.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,死亡人数未知 当局称所有袭击者都被击毙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The death toll is unknown. Authorities say all assailants were killed.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:25.09,1:32:27.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,袭击者成功地突破了...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The attack was thwarted by a joint effort...
Dialogue: 0,1:32:27.46,1:32:29.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,首都警察和联邦警探之后...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...from D. C. police and federal agencies.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:29.66,1:32:32.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,一群武装歹徒成功渗透...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A group of armed assailants managed to penetrate security....
Dialogue: 0,1:32:32.59,1:32:34.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,白宫消息证实总统安然无恙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sources confirm the president is secure.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:34.66,1:32:36.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,另外 国防部长德克...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Secretary of Defense George Deckert...
Dialogue: 0,1:32:37.10,1:32:39.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,今天以最高军事荣誉获得安葬\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}... was buried with full military honors today.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:39.90,1:32:43.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,国防部长德克在国会遇袭事件中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Secretary Deckert lost his life while trying to rescue the president...
Dialogue: 0,1:32:43.41,1:32:45.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,为保护总统而献身\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...during the attack on the Capitol.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:45.51,1:32:48.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他将作为民族英雄而名垂青史\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He will be remembered as one of our nation's greatest heroes.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:48.51,1:32:50.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我爱死这个国家了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I love this town.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:50.51,1:32:54.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们比任何时候都需要英雄\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, more than ever, we need heroes.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:54.42,1:32:56.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,因此 我很荣幸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So it is with great pride...
Dialogue: 0,1:32:56.62,1:32:59.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,把议会荣誉勋章颁发给\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}... that I bestow this Congressional Medal of Honor...
Dialogue: 0,1:32:59.49,1:33:02.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,凯利·克里斯托弗·斯蒂尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...on Kyle Christopher Steele.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:02.99,1:33:06.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,并把这个勋章颁发给一位无名英雄\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I hold this medal for the unknown soldier...
Dialogue: 0,1:33:06.66,1:33:08.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不管他现在身在何处\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}... wherever he may be.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:08.80,1:33:10.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,战争打打停停\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For wars come and go...
Dialogue: 0,1:33:10.77,1:33:14.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,而我们的战士却是永恒不变的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...but my soldiers, they stay eternal.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:15.00,1:33:17.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,总统刚刚引用了图帕克名句?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did the president just quote Tupac?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:17.94,1:33:20.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这个混蛋偷了我的台词\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Son of a bitch stole my line.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:25.48,1:33:26.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,怎么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, what's this?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:28.65,1:33:30.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你又要走?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You out?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:31.95,1:33:33.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你了解我的 罗拉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know me, Lo.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:33.72,1:33:38.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,只有被警察追着的时候 我才过得舒服\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm only good at 100-plus with a couple of cops on my tail.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:38.29,1:33:40.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,而且你在这过得不错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you got a good life here...
Dialogue: 0,1:33:48.80,1:33:52.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这就够我再回味九年的了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That ought to keep me going another nine years.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:54.58,1:33:56.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,德瑞斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}D...
Dialogue: 0,1:33:56.65,1:33:59.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那车有多快?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...how fast did she go?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:59.78,1:34:04.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,220 225\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Two-twenty, 225.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:05.52,1:34:08.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,在我的生命中 排名第二\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The second-best ride of my life.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:26.71,1:34:28.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,德瑞斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}D...
Dialogue: 0,1:34:28.68,1:34:30.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你忘了件东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...you forgot something.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:03.81,1:35:06.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,先生 我对下一任XXX有点建议\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sir, I've got some ideas for the next XXX.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:06.98,1:35:08.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这次总该轮到我挑了吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think it's my turn to choose now.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:08.98,1:35:11.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,别争了 先生们 我来挑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold on, gentlemen. I pick the agents.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:11.59,1:35:15.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我想我们下次需要一个更加难以捉摸的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think we need to go even further off the grid next time.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:16.02,1:35:18.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,新形象 新模样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fresh face. New model.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:18.96,1:35:21.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我已经有了最佳人选\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've got the perfect candidate.
